'''Ranma Saotome (Leotard)''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during [[Ranma 1/2 Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 11.7 Update|Version 11.7]].

